  "slug": "megamenu",
  "title": "Megamenu",
  "lead": "A megamenu is a large, horizontal menu where each item opens a popover to show a large block of navigation links. Megamenu must be used once, on top of the page. Inside each popover, you can use a daisyUI menu, or any custom content. Megamenu fits better on large screens only, and for small screens, you can hide the megamenu and show the content in a dropdown or a drawer.",
