  "prose": [
    {
      "title": null,
      "text": "### Structure\n\nMegamenu is a big menu with a lot of items but it must be responsive and work on all screen sizes.\nOn small screens the whole megamenu must be hidden by default and it must be vertical when visible. A button opens the megamenu and `max-sm:megamenu-vertical` class name to make the megamenu vertical on small screens.  \nOn larger screens, we hide the button and show the megamenu as a horizontal menu, and each button inside the megamenu will open its corresponding popover.",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
